cff-version: 1.2.0
title: "ucai-verify: Zero-Fake-Citation & Cross-Document Numeric Audit Engine"
message: "If you use ucai-verify or UCAI-CitationAudit-Bench-v1 in your research, please cite it using the metadata below."
type: software
version: "0.2.0"
date-released: "2026-11-24"
license: MIT
authors:
