  - "AI co-scientist"
  - "human-in-the-loop"
  - "open science"
abstract: >-
  Deterministic bibliographic cascade (arXiv, Crossref, OpenAlex), page-indexed
  cross-document PDF numeric matcher, and two-stage hybrid semantic polarity
  verifier (Local DeBERTa-v3 NLI & Scoped LLM) for eliminating ghost citations
  and cross-artifact numeric misattribution in AI-assisted scientific writing.
  Ships with UCAI-CitationAudit-Bench-v1 (120 balanced cases across 5 defect classes).
